  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><msup><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, then for a complex number <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Z</mi></math>&nbsp;the minimum value of <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> occurs at",
